  "$comment": "Single source for the redirect layer. scripts/gen-nginx-redirects.mjs turns it into deploy/silo/redirects.conf (nginx, authoritative once infra includes it) and src/pages/go/[key]/index.astro builds static fallback stubs from it. Status: go and vanity are 302 (targets may change), permanent is 301. Keys are stable forever; only targets change. Help targets point at the topic pages (/help/<topic>/) since the help split (2026-10-18). The release tool fetches every artifact file through nginx and compares bytes, so a redirect must never cover a path that exists as a file in the artifact (the stubs live at /go/<key>/index.html and /discord/index.html, which nginx serves as files).",
